}}'''Enderflame''' is a powerful spell that serves as a magical flamethrower. This spell manifests itself as an orange fire that extends from the caster's hand.

== History ==
Enderflame was used by [[the Professor]] to knock [[Sophie Casterwill]] through a wall even when she had used [[Honorguard]] to try to block it. {{source|The Mission}}

This spell was later used by [[Kiel]] in [[Mexico]] to defeat [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Metagolem]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

At the battle of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], Kiel attempted to hit Sophie with this spell but she was defended by [[Sorcerel|Powerbonded Sorcerel]], sending her back to her [[Amulet]]. {{source|The Spiral War}}

